      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "B = patches in the batch; C = channels.\nX, Y, Z = spatial dimensions of EACH channel.\nMore channels = more maps, not more CT slices.\nSmaller patch = smaller spatial field of view.\nFinal scores -> softmax over 63 classes -> probabilities.",
